  "explanation": "Both 'Université Paris IX - Dauphine' and 'University of Bergen' are directly supported by the original sources. D1S5, D1S10, and D1S13 explicitly state that Luca Nenna received his Ph.D. from Université Paris IX - Dauphine. D2S4 clearly states that Luca Nenna was a graduate student at the University of Bergen. While PSL University is mentioned in D1S17 as a broader entity that includes Université Paris IX - Dauphine, it is not directly stated that Luca Nenna attended PSL University itself, so it is excluded."
